---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
	<main class="site-shell">
		<nav class="nav" aria-label="주요 메뉴">
			<a class="brand" href="/">이름 또는 닉네임</a>
			<div class="nav-links">
				<a href="/about">About</a>
				<a href="/projects">Projects</a>
				<a href="/posts">Posts</a>
			</div>
		</nav>

		<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
			<p class="eyebrow">Personal Website</p>
			<h1 id="page-title">이름 또는 닉네임</h1>
			<p class="tagline">한 줄 소개를 여기에 적어주세요.</p>
			<p class="intro">생각, 프로젝트, 글을 차분히 쌓아가는 개인 홈페이지입니다.</p>
			<div class="actions">
				<a class="primary" href="/about">About 보기</a>
				<a class="secondary" href="/projects">Projects 보기</a>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="next-sections" aria-label="앞으로 추가할 섹션">
			<article>
				<span>01</span>
				<h2>About</h2>
				<p>나를 소개하고 관심사, 일하는 방식, 연락 정보를 정리합니다.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<span>02</span>
				<h2>Projects</h2>
				<p>만든 것, 배우는 중인 것, 앞으로 만들고 싶은 것을 모읍니다.</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<span>03</span>
				<h2>Posts</h2>
				<p>짧은 기록부터 긴 글까지 차곡차곡 쌓아갈 공간입니다.</p>
			</article>
		</section>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.site-shell {
		width: min(1040px, calc(100% - 48px));
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 40px 0 72px;
	}

	.nav {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 24px;
		min-height: 44px;
	}

	a {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.brand {
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.nav-links {
		display: flex;
		gap: 24px;
		color: #5f6368;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	.nav-links a:hover,
	.nav-links a:focus-visible {
		color: #17201b;
	}

	.hero {
		display: grid;
		align-content: center;
		min-height: 64vh;
		padding: 92px 0 64px;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 22px;
		color: #666666;
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
	}

	h1 {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 8rem);
		line-height: 1;
		letter-spacing: 0;
	}

	.tagline {
		max-width: 820px;
		margin: 30px 0 0;
		color: #222222;
		font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 3.4vw, 2.4rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.35;
	}

	.intro {
		max-width: 680px;
		margin: 20px 0 0;
		color: #5f6368;
		font-size: 1.08rem;
		line-height: 1.75;
	}

	.actions {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 34px;
	}

	.primary,
	.secondary {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-height: 46px;
		padding: 0 20px;
		border: 1px solid #171717;
		border-radius: 6px;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.primary {
		background: #171717;
		color: #ffffff;
	}

	.secondary {
		color: #171717;
	}

	.next-sections {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 24px;
		border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
		padding-top: 32px;
	}

	.next-sections article {
		min-height: 190px;
		padding: 0;
	}

	.next-sections span {
		color: #8a8a8a;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.next-sections h2 {
		margin: 42px 0 12px;
		font-size: 1.4rem;
	}

	.next-sections p {
		margin: 0;
		color: #5f6368;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.site-shell {
			width: min(100% - 32px, 1040px);
			padding-top: 24px;
		}

		.nav {
			align-items: flex-start;
			flex-direction: column;
		}

		.nav-links {
			width: 100%;
			justify-content: space-between;
			gap: 10px;
		}

		.hero {
			min-height: auto;
			padding: 64px 0 48px;
		}

		h1 {
			font-size: 4rem;
		}

		.next-sections {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 28px;
		}
	}
</style>
